Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:02:01 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] patch106 (GitHub #329, reviews r78 / r79): Gears 3 saves -
 recent runs' keys and --cogbox_save_adopt_key converted with a check; a
 whole, plausible save signed for an unknown key re-signed (copy kept,
 loop-guarded) instead of reset; failed reads never taken for empty files;
 Gears 3 / Judgment saves copied before a run with another signing key, only
 COGBox's own redundant copies ever pruned

